review_text:
tried The Classic two eggs, bacon, and their Habla Diablo seasoned potatoes plus their homemade Banana Nut Muffin,
and honestly everything tasted just okay the eggs and bacon were exactly what you’d expect from a standard diner breakfast, the potatoes didn’t really show off the “Diablo” seasoning people rave about online, and the muffin, which many reviews call a must-try and one of the best in town, felt pretty ordinary and forgettable;
overall, it was a decent plate, but nothing special like the glowing reviews suggest
